      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS STAR LEE (4) was overdue for a win and racing consistently, finishing in the minors three on end, before finding trouble last time and finishing seventh in a Novice race at this track (18.01). Better than latest and well worth another try. MAKUTZ (1) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when fourth (17.67) in a Novice race at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. FUNNY FINNY (7) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (17.58) at this track behind Armani's Girl in a Novice race. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expecting another good run. THAT'S SO TED (2) raced handy last time and scored. Must be respected.",
